@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
class SampleCase {
  - capacity : int
  - count : int
  + SampleCase(capacity : int)
  + getCapacity() : int
  + getCount() : int
  + getFreeSpace() : int
  + store(amount : int) : boolean
  + unload() : int
}
note right of SampleCase
  容量建構時修正到1..8
  初始空盒
  非正數或超量整批拒絕
  拒絕時存量不變
end note
@enduml
